3. ruffle-miyooflip — documentation reference only
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
What was used: only the project's documentation, consulted to understand how
the Ruffle binary handles controller/keyboard input on handheld devices. No
source code, scripts, or binaries from this project were copied, modified, or
redistributed.

Source: https://github.com/aweigit/ruffle-miyooflip

License: please refer to the LICENSE file in the ruffle-miyooflip repository
for the authoritative, up-to-date terms, since it is not reproduced here —
this project did not use their code, only their public documentation as a
reference.

